Sub: First Semester MCA - Scheme of evaluation of each program – instructions issued.
All students of first Semester MCA are informed the following:
    1. In order to attend the lab, rough record with the completed algorithm should be submitted.
    2. The program has to be developed in a professional way meeting all requirements. It should also show Name of the program, name of the developer and the date. Enough comments are to be added to describe the actions.  Validations on input data by user are to be made as per the description of the problem.
    3. Evaluation is done for maximum of 30 marks for each question. Quality of the code is decided by Style of Coding and Readability, Introduction of in line Comments, Efficiency of Code etc. The scheme for evaluation is as follows: Completion – 10 Marks, Output/Record  - 10 Marks & Viva -10 Marks
